WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.726
But now there is a side effect, which

00:00:01.726 --> 00:00:03.396
is the issue of missing migrant workers

00:00:03.396 --> 00:00:05.197
. We know that the number of migrant

00:00:05.197 --> 00:00:07.093
workers in Taiwan is about 900,000, and

00:00:07.093 --> 00:00:08.894
the number of missing migrant workers

00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:10.458
is around 90,000, which is about

00:00:10.458 --> 00:00:12.390
one-tenth. I saw some data that there

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:14.352
are 70,000 police officers in Taiwan.

00:00:14.352 --> 00:00:15.964
Even if every officer caught one

00:00:15.964 --> 00:00:17.723
missing migrant worker, there would

00:00:17.723 --> 00:00:19.560
still be 20,000 left. Could this be a

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.293
problem that needs to be considered in

00:00:21.293 --> 00:00:22.593
policy supporting measures?

00:00:22.593 --> 00:00:24.266
>> Indeed, because what we are most

00:00:24.266 --> 00:00:26.193
worried about is the resulting social

00:00:26.193 --> 00:00:28.280
problems. Including public safety, or

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.276
the possibility that because they are

00:00:30.276 --> 00:00:31.905
foreign workers, they might be

00:00:31.905 --> 00:00:33.901
controlled by others while working in

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:37.093
Taiwan. And then their personal safety

00:00:37.093 --> 00:00:41.995
or freedom might be compromised. So,

00:00:41.995 --> 00:00:44.156
the Executive Yuan has indeed proposed

00:00:44.156 --> 00:00:46.151
a plan to continuously assist these

00:00:46.151 --> 00:00:48.367
foreign workers, including what kind of

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:50.583
help the government can provide if they

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:55.873
come forward. We are also gradually

00:00:55.873 --> 00:00:57.918
trying to resolve this, for instance

00:00:57.918 --> 00:01:00.018
regarding their methods of contact; I

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:02.228
can't disclose some details, but we are

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.052
indeed treating this as a policy

00:01:04.052 --> 00:01:07.002
initiative.

00:01:07.002 --> 00:01:11.002
>> OK.
